  "notes": "Often used as a noun ({箱詰|はこづ}め) to describe boxed goods, especially food products sold as gifts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {箱詰|はこづ}めにする: to box up\n- {箱詰|はこづ}めの{果物|くだもの}: boxed fruit\n- {箱詰|はこづ}めギフト: boxed gift set\n- {箱詰|はこづ}め{作業|さぎょう}: packing work\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {梱包|こんぽう}する: to pack, package — more formal, used for shipping\n- {詰|つ}める: to pack, stuff — general verb for filling a container\n- {包装|ほうそう}する: to wrap, package — focuses on wrapping",
